Not bundled, and deliberately so:

  CUDA / cuDNN are proprietary NVIDIA components. They are never redistributed
  here; a user who wants GPU acceleration installs them themselves.

  Model weights are not distributed with this application. They are downloaded by
  the user, and their licences are the model publishers' own. Only OSI-licensed
  weights are offered as defaults — see CONTRIBUTING.md.

  Research papers are not redistributed. arXiv's default licence grants
  distribution rights to arXiv, not to third parties. Papers are fetched by the
  user's own machine, cached locally, and never re-served. Each cached paper
  records its arXiv id, licence string and fetch time.
